  partName: Rear Sensor
  description: The Rear Sensor is a tiny, complex-shaped component located at the
    top-center-rear of the engine, playing a crucial role in monitoring the engine's
    performance and sending vital data to the engine control unit. Its material,
    Material.001, ensures durability and resistance to extreme temperatures. Interestingly,
    the Rear Sensor's complex shape allows it to detect multiple parameters simultaneously,
    making it a vital component for optimal engine performance.
